ry":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\nv4.8.dev2.official [7220d456d]\nv4.7.1.stable.official [a13da4feb]\nv4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev2 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nRight-click doesn't cancel a polygon point drag in the viewport.\nIt shows the viewport's right-click menu.\n\n<img width=\"488\" height=\"263\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8d2da00-b457-4d1b-b440-8f1e97a2626e\" />\n\n### Where it works\nRight-click does works to cancel a point drag in the polygon editor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n### Reproduction steps\n- open the project: [rmb-doesn't-cancel-viewport-polygon-point-drag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30524087/rmb-doesn.t-cancel-viewport-polygon-point-drag.zip)\n- in the scene panel, select: Polygon2D\n- left drag a polygon point in the viewport\n- while dragging: right-click\n\n### Issue\n\nThe viewport's right-click menu opens:\n> Add 2D Node Here...\n> Instantiate Scene Here...\n> Move Node(s) Here\n\nIt might seem like a proposal, but the canceled drag can't be undone, because it doesn't add an undo step.\n\n### Expected\nCancel the point drag and return the point to the pre-drag location.\nThis already works when dragging a polygon point in the Polygon Editor.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b1117c7-cf33-4752-a5c4-06b85b14b74e\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rmb-doesn't-cancel-viewport-polygon-point-drag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30524087/rmb-doesn.t-cancel-viewport-polygon-point-drag.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121914/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}